527		The estimates transfer from $N^W_h$ to $\phi_{\mathrm{A}} \, (M^{(\mathrm{Pauli},W)}_h)_{\mathrm{A}} \, \phi_{\mathrm{A}}^\dagger$ as follows. Write $\ket{\Delta} = \ket{\mathrm{aux}} \ot \ket{\mathrm{EPR}_q}^{\ot M}$ and $\ket{\vartheta} = \phi_{\mathrm{A}} \ot \phi_{\mathrm{B}} \ket{\psi}$. Since $\phi_{\mathrm{A}}^\dagger \phi_{\mathrm{A}} = \Id$, the projection $\Id - Q_{\mathrm{A}}$ annihilates $\ket{\vartheta}$, so the displayed bound above gives
