533		\]
534		Since the strategy is projective, the operators $N^W_h$, for $h \in \F_q^M$, are mutually orthogonal projectors summing to the identity, so $\sum_h \| N^W_h \ket{\xi} \|^2 = \| \ket{\xi} \|^2$ for every vector $\ket{\xi}$. Decomposing
